;--c-sm:6;--c-md:4;--c-lg:4"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fsvrPk ezIRGP pf-39_"><a href="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0549/1972/5110/files/Wine_Hardware_Specifications.pdf?v=1645737890" target="_blank" data-pf-type="Button" class="sc-kbovfZ KIYWl pf-40_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fFlofg cnCjdX pf-42_">Wine Hardware Specifications</span></a></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:4;--c-lg:4"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fsvrPk ezIRGP pf-43_"><a href="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0549/1972/5110/files/Kessick_Wine_Panel_Installation_Guide.pdf?v=1744124799" target="_blank" data-pf-type="Button" class="sc-kbovfZ KIYWl pf-44_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fFlofg cnCjdX pf-46_">Wine Panel Instructions</span></a></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:4;--c-lg:4"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fsvrPk ezIRGP pf-47_"><a href="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0549/1972/5110/files/Kessick_Wine_Wall_Installation_Guide.pdf?v=1744124799" target="_blank" data-pf-type="Button" class="sc-kbovfZ KIYWl pf-48_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fFlofg cnCjdX pf-50_">Wine Wall Instructions</span></a></div></div></div><div class="sc-hzhKNl fltMam pf-51_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fsvrPk ezIRGP pf-52_"><p class="sc-dQEsWe kFLVLU pf-53_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fFlofg cnCjdX pf-55_"><span style="font-style: italic;">Kessick LLC is committed to high quality products and great customer service. It is our desire to have satisfied
customers that enjoy their Kessick wine storage system and are pleased with the aesthetics and function as well
as the installation process. Kessick Wine As Art products have been designed and engineered to enable the best
possible customer experience.</span></span></p><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-cVzzKN eMDdXJ pf-56_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fFlofg cnCjdX pf-58_">Installation Disclaimer</span></h3><p class="sc-dQEsWe kFLVLU pf-59_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fFlofg cnCjdX pf-61_"><span style="font-weight: bold;">INSTALLATION</span>: Kessick Wine Storage Systems, LLC (“Kessick”)directs you our customer (“Customer”) to the InstallationGuide and Installation Video included on our website(www.wineasaert.com) for your new Kessick <span style="font-style: italic;">WinePanel</span>™System or <span style="font-style: italic;">WineWall</span>™ System. The Installation Guide andInstallation Video are for informational use only and shall notbe regarded as a warranty. It is imperative that the installerof your new Kessick Wine Panel System or Wine Wall Systemreview and understand the specifications and logisticsunique to the Customer’s chosen location for installation, aswell as the written instructions in the Installation Guide andthe Installation Video prior to beginning installation. It is theresponsibility of the installer to understand the installationinstructions contained within the Installation Guide andInstallation Video, or to obtain clarification of the installationinstructions, prior to beginning the installation process, andto follow all applicable local building codes.<br><br>The Wine Panel System and Wine Wall System have beendesigned and engineered to securely fasten a back-panel to a<span style="font-weight: bold;">wood framed structural wall</span> (gypsum board over wood 2x4,typical) and to support the weight of the finished panel withthe Kessick-supplied wine bottle hardware and a “live load” ofwine bottles, at a maximum weight of 3lbs per wine bottle.</span></p><ul style="--text-indent:0;--line-spacing:10px" data-pf-type="List" class="sc-bJBfJu dtguIi pf-62_"><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-dGCntx fFmYzz pf-63_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fFlofg cnCjdX pf-65_"><span style="font-style: italic;">WinePanel</span>™ System: The Wine Panel System is designed for installation of the back-panel directly to a vertical wall surface, using the Kessick-supplied wood screws, into a <span style="font-weight: bold;">wood framing structure</span>. If a wood framing structure is not available, “hollow wall anchors” can be used. Refer to the hollow wall anchors manufacturer’s instruction for proper and safe application. To that end, Kessick strongly advises the Customer to engage a licensed professional to install the Wine Panel System into any non-wood framed structure. <br><span style="font-weight: bold;">WARNING: IMPROPER INSTALLATION OF THE WINE PANEL SYSTEM (INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO FAILURE TO FOLLOW THE INSTALLATION GUIDE OR INSTALLATION VIDEO) MAY RESULT IN SERIOUS PERSONAL INJURY. INSTALLATION OF THE WINE PANEL SYSTEM INTO ANY STRUCTUREOTHER THAN WOOD-FRAMING (INCLUDINGBUT NOT LIMITED TO MASONRY, BRICK, BLOCK,CONCRETE, OR STONE) SHOULD BE PERFORMEDBY A LICENSED PROFESSIONAL ONLY.</span></span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-dGCntx fFmYzz pf-66_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fFlofg cnCjdX pf-68_"><span style="font-style: italic;">WineWall</span>™ System: The Wine Panel back-panel shouldbe installed directly into a vertical wall surface with theKessick-supplied wood screws into a wood framingstructure. The Wine Wall System requires a minimumof 3 wood screws for every 14” x 14” area (i.e., 42”x42” – 18 wood screws into wall studs). <span style="font-weight: bold;">*Hollow wallanchors are not acceptable fasteners for installationof the Wine Wall System and are NOT TO BE USEDin installation of the Wine Wall System. Metal wallstuds are not suitable for installation unless sheathedwith  ” –  ” plywood.</span> * Kessick strongly advises theCustomer to engage a licensed professional to installthe Wine Wall System into any non-wood framed (i.e.,masonry, brick, block, concrete, stone) structures.<br><span style="font-weight: bold;">WARNING: IMPROPER INSTALLATION OF THEWINE WALL SYSTEM (INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITEDTO THE USE OF HOLLOW WALL ANCHORS, ORMETAL WALL STUDS UNSHEATHED TO  ” –  ”PLYWOOD, OR FAILURE TO FOLLOW THEINSTALLATION GUIDE OR INSTALLATION VIDEO)MAY RESULT IN SERIOUS PERSONAL INJURY.INSTALLATION OF THE WINE WALL SYSTEMINTO ANY STRUCTURE OTHER THAN WOODFRAMING,INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TOMASONRY, BRICK, BLOCK, CONCRETE, ORSTONE, SHOULD BE PERFORMED BY A LICENSEDPROFESSIONAL ONLY.</span></span></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-5b7d" data-pf-type="Section" id="warranty" class="sc-fbKhWw dHaUDq pf-69_"><div style="--cw:1170px" class="sc-dhFVuh jkEGqE"><div class="sc-hzhKNl fltMam pf-70_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fsvrPk ezIRGP pf-71_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-cVzzKN eMDdXJ pf-72_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fFlofg cnCjdX pf-74_">Warranty</span></h3><p class="sc-dQEsWe kFLVLU pf-75_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fFlofg cnCjdX pf-77_">LIMITED WARRANTY: Kessick warrants the high quality andusability of the <span style="font-style: italic;">WinePanel</span>™ System and <span style="font-style: italic;">WineWall</span>™ System(the “Products”) for the extent of the Product’s life. This serviceprotects against any defects in materials or workmanshipperformed by Kessick. Should a defect arise, contact usimmediately. “Defect” refers to, but is not limited to, occurrences of warping and bowing, splitting, or cracking of the of thebase-panel, as well as delamination of top panel or edgebanding. Kessick will replace the defective part or send afull replacement.<br><br>Customer is responsible for notifying Kessick of defectsbelieved to be covered by this Warranty within 10 days ofreceiving the product. We reserve the right to inspect anyitem for product failure and may request photographs of orthe return of the product. This Warranty is limited to the costof repair or replacement of the defective item. It is advisableto inspect the Products once you have received them forany signs of defects in the Products themselves and theKessick-supplied hardware.<br><br><span style="font-weight: bold;">What is Not Covered</span><br>This limited warranty does not cover any damage, deteriorationor malfunction resulting from the Customer’s handling orinstallation of the Products, or the removal of the Productsfrom any installation, any unauthorized tampering with theProducts, any repairs attempted by anyone unauthorizedby Kessick to make such repairs, or any other cause thatdoes not relate directly to a defect in materials and/orworkmanship of the Products.<br><br>This limited warranty does not cover any damage, deteriorationor malfunction resulting from any alteration, modification,improper or unreasonable use or maintenance, misuse,abuse, accident, neglect, exposure to excess moisture, fire,lightning, power surges, or other acts of nature.<br><br><span style="font-weight: bold;">Who is Covered</span><br>Only the original purchaser of the Products is covered underthis limited warranty. This limited warranty is not transferableto subsequent purchaser or owners of the Products.<br><span style="font-weight: bold;"><br>How Kessick Will Help</span><br>Kessick will, at its sole discretion, provide one of the followingthree remedies to whatever extent it shall deem necessary tosatisfy a proper claim under this limited warranty: 1. Elect torepair or facilitate the repair of any defective parts withina reasonable period of time, free of any charge for thenecessary parts and labor to complete the repair and restore this product to its proper operating condition. Kessick willalso pay the shipping costs necessary to return this productonce the repair is complete. 2. Replace this product. 3. Issuea refund of the original purchase price less depreciation tobe determined based on the age of the product at the timeremedy is sought under this limited warranty.<br><br><span style="font-weight: bold;">Obtaining a Remedy under this Limited Warranty</span><br>To obtain a remedy under this limited warranty, you musteither contact the authorized Kessick distributor or ouroffices directly at sales@kessick.com. The return form mustalso be filled out and returned with the product. This productshould be properly packed, preferably in the original carton,for shipping.</span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-2195" data-pf-type="Section" id="disclaimer" class="sc-fbKhWw dHaUDq pf-78_"><div style="--cw:1170px" class="sc-dhFVuh jkEGqE"><div class="sc-hzhKNl fltMam pf-79_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fsvrPk ezIRGP pf-80_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-cVzzKN eMDdXJ pf-81_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fFlofg cnCjdX pf-83_">Limitation of Liability</span></h3><p class="sc-dQEsWe kFLVLU pf-84_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fFlofg cnCjdX pf-86_"><span style="font-weight: bold;">Disclaimer of Liability</span><br>Kessick disclaims liability for incidental or consequentialdamages and assumes no responsibility or liability for anyloss or damage suffered by any person as a result of the useor misuse of any of any of its products, or the installation orhandling of its products.<br><br><span style="font-weight: bold;">Limitation on Liability</span><br>KESSICK’S MAXIMUM LIABILITY UNDER THIS LIMITEDWARRANTY SHALL NOT EXCEED THE ACTUAL PURCHASEPRICE PAID FOR THE PRODUCT. TO THE MAXIMUM EXTENTPERMITTED BY LAW, KESSICK IS NOT RESPONSIBLE FORDIRECT, SPECIAL, INCIDENTAL OR CONSEQUENTIALDAMAGES RESULTING FROM ANY BREACH OF WARRANTYOR CONDITION, OR UNDER ANY OTHER LEGAL THEORY.<br><br><span style="font-weight: bold;">Exclusive Remedy</span><br>TO THE MAXIMUM EXTENT PERMITTED BY LAW, THISLIMITED WARRANTY AND THE REMEDIES SET FORTHABOVE ARE EXCLUSIVE AND IN LIEU OF ALL OTHERWARRANTIES, REMEDIES AND CONDITIONS, WHETHERORAL OR WRITTEN, EXPRESS OR IMPLIED. TO THE MAXIMUMEXTENT PERMITTED BY LAW, KESSICK SPECIFICALLYDISCLAIMS ANY AND ALL IMPLIED WARRANTIES.<br><br><span style="font-weight: bold;">Questions?</span><br>Please contact Customer Support at sales@kessick.com.</span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-f167" data-pf-type="Section" id="returns" class="sc-fbKhWw dHaUDq pf-87_"><div style="--cw:1170px" class="sc-dhFVuh jkEGqE"><div class="sc-hzhKNl fltMam pf-88_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fsvrPk ezIRGP pf-89_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-cVzzKN eMDdXJ pf-90_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fFlofg cnCjdX pf-92_">Shipping Policy</span></h3><p class="sc-dQEsWe kFLVLU pf-93_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fFlofg cnCjdX pf-95_">All wine panels and wine walls are made to order and will typically ship in 1-2 weeks. Custom orders ship in 4-6 weeks. We will communicate promptly if there will be a delay in shipping. We ship via UPS and cannot ship to a P.O. Box.</span></p><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-cVzzKN eMDdXJ pf-96_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fFlofg cnCjdX pf-98_">Returns</span></h3><p class="sc-dQEsWe kFLVLU pf-99_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fFlofg cnCjdX pf-101_">We hope you are in love with your new Wine as Art wine wall or wine panel. However, we know things happen from time to time, so please review the return policy below.<br><br><span style="font-weight: bold;">Shipping Damage</span>:  Please take a photo of the damaged package and any damage to the panel(s) and email us the photo along with the order number. We will assess the damage to determine what pieces need to be replaced.<br><br><span style="font-weight: bold;">Mistake in the Order</span>:  We work hard to ensure your order is correct, but if there is an error or a discrepancy, we will make it right! Please contact us so we can determine the best course of action. We will correct the mistake or issue a full refund, including shipping.<br><br><span style="font-weight: bold;">Changed Your Mind</span>: We accept returns within 30 days of receipt. Items must be unused and returned in the original packaging. Because we make each panel to order, a restocking fee of 30% will be assessed. Custom orders are not eligible for return.<br><br><span style="font-weight: bold;">Questions</span>:  Please contact us at sales@kessick.com.
</span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><script>
